Subject: [PATCH] fix(vm): account active execution stack and guard exception entry

Measure native SP against usable coroutine capacity, restore bounds on the parent stack, and fail closed below the experimental EH reserve. Host callbacks deliberately have no suspended-stack snapshot. Includes nested/trap/invariant tests. Linux x86_64 tested; other supported mechanisms remain unqualified.

Base: published wasmer-vm-7.2.1 crate, apply from its crate root with git apply.
Experimental candidate; not a merged upstream change.

